 for Accurate Breast Cancer Mammogram Classification</strong>\n<em> Puttegowda, V. Veeraprathap, H.S.R. Kumar, K.V. Sudheesh</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Optimized Image Compression Using Multiple Compressed Sensing Techniques</strong>\n<em> Puttegowda, B.A. Mohan, V. Veeraprathap, C.P. Vijay, K.V. Sudheesh</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Optimized Machine Learning Techniques for Precise Breast Cancer Detection in Mammograms</strong>\n<em> Kiran, V. Veeraprathap, U. Rajashekhar, M. Mahantesh, K.V. Sudheesh</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Advanced Machine Learning Techniques for Prognostic Analysis in Breast Cancer</strong>\n<em> Puttegowda, V. Ravi, V. Veeraprathap, P. Ravi, G.R. Yathiraj, D.S. Sunil Kumar</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Automated Raga Recognition in Indian Classical Music Using Machine Learning Techniques</strong>\n<em> Humse, R.K. H.S., L.S. Ramachandra, G.R. Yathiraj, K. Puttegowda, V. Veeraprathap</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Machine Learning Based 64-QAM Classification Techniques for Enhanced Optical Communication</strong>\n<em> Kiran, H.L. Gururaj, Francesco Flammini, V. Veeraprathap</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Intermediate Learning-Based Attention Regulated Densenet for Diagnosis of Covid-19</strong>\n<em>Roshan Shetty, N. Prasad, D.V. Manjunatha</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Machine Learning Based 64-QAM Classification Techniques for Enhanced Optical Communication</strong>\n<em> Kiran, H.L. Gururaj, Francesco Flammini, D.S. Sunil Kumar, V. Veeraprathap</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Artificial Intelligence-Driven Forensic Analysis of Digital Images for Cybersecurity Investigations</strong>\n<em>B. Gunawan Widjaja, V. Veeraprathap, A. Abdul Khadar, T. Tshomo, H.A. Khayoon</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Accessibility Book Scanner with Automatic Page Turner </strong><strong>–</strong><strong> A Review</strong>\n<em> D.K., L. Lal, S. H.M.</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>A Review: Sign Language Converter Using Hand Gloves</strong>\n<em>K., V. Veeraprathap, Shashank, Shashank Shetty</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Machine Learning Models Based Crop Recommendation and Plant Disease Identification for Real-Time Application</strong>\n<em>D. Parameshachari, B.S. Balaji, D.S. Sunil Kumar, K.V. Sudheesh</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3D Modeling of MEMS Based Micro-Cantilever Vibration Sensor</strong>\n<em>V. Manjunatha, V. Veeraprathap, Bhagyashree K.</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>IoT-Based Electric Fencing Monitoring System in Agricultural Farm</strong>\n<em>Veeraprathap V., Mahak Narang, others</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Design and Implementation of Stochastic Resource Algorithm for Interweave and Underlay Conditions in Cognitive Radio Networks</strong>\n<em>Veeraprathap V., others</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Analysis of Hybrid Nano Composite PVA-PDMS Thin Films for Hydrophobic Applications</strong>\n<em>Swetha M.S., Guru Prasad B., V. Veeraprathap</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Secured Data Communication for Lung Cancer Detection and Multi-Level Classification</strong>\n<em> Narendra Kumar, V. Veeraprathap, Sneha N., Anusha B. Pai A.</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Software Defined Radio for WSN in Real-Time Healthcare Monitoring System</strong>\n<em> Narendra Kumar, V. Veeraprathap, Ashish Hegde, Supriya V. Kurpad</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Medical Sensor Network Based Real-Time Activity and Healthcare Monitoring for Mute and Paralytic Persons</strong>\n<em>S. Harish, G. Narendra Kumar, V. Veeraprathap, Fazaluddeen D.M.</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Enhanced Lung Cancer Detection and Multi-Level Classification of MRI with CT Images</strong>\n<em> Narendra Kumar, G.S. Harish, V. Veeraprathap, Fazaluddeen D.M.</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Modified Efficient Protection of Palm Disaster from RPW Larvae Using WSNs</strong>\n<em> Narendra Kumar, V. Veeraprathap, Ramya B.K.</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Lung Cancer Detection and Multi-Level Classification Using Discrete Wavelet Transform Approach</strong>\n<em> Narendra Kumar, V. Veeraprathap, G.S. Harish</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>SENSORCOMM </strong><strong>–</strong><strong> Design and Development of Medical Sensor Networks for Differently Abled Persons</strong>\n<em>Fazaluddeen D.M., G. Narendra Kumar, V. Veeraprathap</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Network on Chip Design and Implementation on FPGA with Advanced Hardware and Networking Functionalities</strong>\n<em> Z. Kurian, V. Veeraprathap, M. Nagaraja</em></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Network Interface Design and Implementation for NoC on FPGA with Advanced Hardware and Networking Functionalities</strong>\n<em> Veeraprathap, M. Nagaraja, M.Z. Kurian</em></li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>MEMBERSHIP IN PROFESSIONAL BODIES</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid bl